    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR5c0126-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.3-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">Xiāoyáoyóu Dì Yī</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">In the Northern Ocean, there is a fish,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">its name is Kūn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">The Kūn's size,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">no one knows how many thousands of miles it is.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">It transforms into a bird,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">its name is Péng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">The Péng's back,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">no one knows how many thousands of miles it is;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">when it rages and flies,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">its wings are like clouds hanging from the sky.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:35:41.357+09:00">This bird,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">By sea, it will then migrate to Nán Míng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">Nán Míng is the celestial pond.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">Qí Xié was,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">a recorder of marvels.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">"When the Péng migrates to Nán Míng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">it strikes the water for three thousand *lǐ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">whirling upwards ninety thousand *lǐ* on a cyclone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">departing with the June winds."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">The roaming dust-like mist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">the floating dust,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">are blown about by the breath of living creatures.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">The blueness of the sky,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">is that its true color?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">Or is it so far that there is no end to its extent?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">When it looks down below,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">it probably sees things in the same way.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">Furthermore, if the accumulation of water is not deep,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">then it will not have the strength to bear a large boat.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">Pour a cup of water in a depression in the hall floor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">and a mustard seed will be a boat for it;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">put a cup in it, and it will stick,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">because the water is shallow and the boat is large.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">If the accumulation of wind is not deep,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">then it will not have the strength to bear a large wing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T13:37:07.568+09:00">Therefore, to rise ninety thousand *lǐ*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">Then the wind is pressing below,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">and only then does it gather strength;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">carrying the blue sky on its back, // with nothing to cut it short,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">and only then does it plan to fly south.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">The cicada and the dove laugh at it, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">"I leap up and fly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">bumping into elms and rafters,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">sometimes not even reaching them, // but simply landing on the ground;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">why go ninety thousand *lǐ* to the south?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">He who goes to the nearby wilds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">returns with three meals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">his stomach still full;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">he who goes a hundred *lǐ*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">pounds grain overnight;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">he who goes a thousand *lǐ*</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">gathers provisions for three months.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">What do these two insects know!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">Small knowledge does not reach great knowledge,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">a short lifespan does not reach a long lifespan.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">How do we know that this is so?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">The morning mushroom does not know morning and dusk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">the cicada does not know spring and autumn;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">these are short lifespans.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">South of Chǔ is Mínglíng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">who takes five hundred years for a spring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">and five hundred years for an autumn;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">in ancient times there was Dàchūn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">who takes eight thousand years for a spring,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">and eight thousand years for an autumn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">Yet Péngzǔ is now uniquely known for his longevity;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">the multitude try to match him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_001-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-08T14:05:21.944+09:00">is it not sad!</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
